{
  "version": 1,
  "_about": "A synthesised break kit for ~174 BPM. No samples: the snare is a tuned body plus pink noise, the cymbals are the inharmonic metal oscillator, and ghost notes come from velocity rather than from separate sounds -- play 38 softly and it thins out by itself.",
